#   - 多行值: 下一行以空格开头 = 续行
#   - 列表值: 逗号分隔
#   - 正则值: | 分隔多个模式
#   - 以 # 开头的行为注释
#   - 空行忽略
#====================================================================

# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id: E429
trigger_tool: python|conan
phase: testing
error_signature: ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'dill'|Parent CWD import succeeds but script-mode child import fails

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity: 2
category: python, testing, packaging, subprocess
match_keywords: script-mode child, sys.path[0], python -m, cwd-only import, dill.tests, inherited PYTHONPATH, installed origin, source-independent test
title: Python -m runner 的 CWD 导入不会传给 script-mode 子解释器：用安装来源与继承环境双向验证防止源码假通过

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: The parent python -m runner locates its package through current-directory sys.path[0]; subprocess Python script invocations instead set sys.path[0] to their test-script directory. sys.path mutations are process-local. The dependency is the package under test itself, so installing unrelated dependencies is wrong. Adding source PYTHONPATH fixes execution but does not prove the installed artifact; use a private setuptools installation and an independent working directory with inherited installed-root PYTHONPATH and origin assertions.
affected_scope: Standalone Python test runners spawning script-mode child interpreters without overriding inherited env; Conan packages containing their own tests
verification_cmd: Run original python -m dill.tests with PYTHONPATH unset, then with source root inherited; run staged installed suite from a separate directory; remove installed payload and verify consumers fail, restore and rerun.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: installed-origin-plus-child-environment-proof
rec_description: Diagnose parent and child import paths before adding dependencies; install via published build tools into build-private site; inherit that site through PYTHONPATH; run unchanged upstream scripts from an empty verification directory; assert module origin and execute a fresh-interpreter consumer; perform a reversible payload removal negative control. Count runner scripts separately from conditional optional branches.
rec_command: Environment().prepend_path("PYTHONPATH", installed_site); python -s -P -m dill.tests from verification directory (-P on Python >=3.11 only)
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Conan build-private install, inherited Environment, origin checks, independent cwd and payload-removal control

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
# forbid_N_pattern:     正则(|分隔), 匹配则拒绝/警告
# forbid_N_reason:      为什么禁止
# forbid_N_consequence: 违反后的后果
forbid_1_pattern: replace.*sys.path.*parent.*only|pip install dill.*global
forbid_1_reason: Parent-only sys.path does not cross exec; global installation can mask missing Conan artifacts
forbid_1_consequence: All children still fail or consumer tests pass against unrelated ambient package
# forbid_2_pattern:
# forbid_2_reason:
# forbid_2_consequence:

# ═══ Layer 4: 原则引用 ═══
# principles:    适用的原则 ID 列表(逗号分隔), 在 graph/principles.kv 中定义
principles:

# ═══ 关系图 (Relations) ═══
# causes:          本模式是这些模式的根因 (修好本模式可能同时解决它们)
# caused_by:       本模式的根因是这些模式 (应先修它们)
# similar_to:      特征相似可能混淆的模式
# conflicts_with:  解决方案互相冲突的模式
# prerequisite_of: 本模式是修复这些模式的前置条件
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to: E319,E512
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

